"Bi De once met a vast, ancient, wordless Earth Spirit deep underground and offered it Qi."
"Soon Bi De organizes Fa Ram's scouting and defenses against a feared Flying Demon incursion."
"Later this year Bi De leads a Fa Ram strike force against a demon hornet swarm in the Ash Forest."
"In the Ash Forest war Bi De allies with the Blaze Bear survivors under Huishou."
